{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve containment when every clock sample stalls**\n\nUsing the midpoint leaves up to half the sampling window as epoch error. Under repeated scheduler or GC pauses, ordinary user spans can consequently end after their SDK parents; the added stalled-sample test observes this residual and skips containment assertions. Retain the bracket endpoints and derive conservative lower-bound starts and upper-bound ends, then require containment in every stalled fixture.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs77EXmE","finding_digest":"eb83580fb6c6151f56b816d070253ecd2eea42747ad77dfe9353b102e28878f5","finding_id":"arf_v1_5obvqd5wyykr6vvyc3ihajj6zu","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts::captureinvocationclock::stalled-sample-containment","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts::captureinvocationclock::stalled-sample-containment","line":25,"observation_digest":"6c074517a5369d0a21e2c4671e44fd41291a785891c4507b6ae50412ec443562","observation_id":"aro_v1_nqdukf5fg2oquipcyrtr4rh5ie","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-clock.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5obvqd5wyykr6vvyc3ihajj6zu","published_at":"2026-10-07T21:34:29Z","review_id":"arr_v1_goi76jqbo6yiwl7tqllz2b56m4","reviewed_base_sha":"19ee19fa0619093943f079b69943f7b5cdee7ac7","reviewed_head_sha":"6550bccda81cba81a108c4e4d4c59d4561e2b0a2","reviewer":"codex","start_line":25,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":962},"record_id":"art_v1_o7rb5waf6zbeevfzjhmw3b7ndx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T21:34:29Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
